   Bowman, Russell, Soil \& Struct Ltd, Glasgow, Lanark, Scotland.
   Butt, Talib E., Northumbria Univ, Fac Engn \& Environm, Newcastle Upon Tyne NE1 8ST, Tyne \& Wear, England.},
